# AGENTS.md

This repository uses KRN Harness.

## KRN Workflow

- Before non-trivial work, run `krn status`.
- Start the task with `krn start "<task>"`, then run `krn context`.
- Read `.krn/current/task-contract.md` and `.krn/current/context-package.md`.
- Use `.agents/skills/krn-harness/SKILL.md` for the KRN workflow if available.
- Do not edit if KRN reports STOP.
- After edits, run `krn verify --execute` when a configured executable verify profile exists or the task requires executable verification.
- If executable verification is not configured or not allowed, run `krn verify` and record why it stayed record-only.
- Run `krn handoff`.

For visual or layout work, include concrete sizes before starting the task, for example mobile 320-480px, tablet 768-1024px, desktop 1280-1440px, or the actual element size/tolerance the user gave.

`.krn/` may be gitignored, but it is active local runtime state.
